        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: José Fernández\n- Organizations: Miami Marlins\n- Topics: 2016 Miami Marlins season, baseball, death\n\nFacts:\n- José Fernández played his final season with the Miami Marlins during the 2016 Miami Marlins season.\n- José Fernández was affectionately known as \"Niño\" by his teammates and fans because of the youthful exuberance with which he played baseball.\n- José Fernández died in a boating accident on September 25, making 2016 his final season.",
